OL,3,GNEWSATown gets in a flap over High
OL,4,AStreet pigeon mess
OL,5,
OL,6,FPigeons have been leaving a town's High
OL,7,FStreet looking dirty and efforts to
OL,8,Fdeter the birds from congregating have
OL,9,Ffailed, a mayor has said.
OL,11,FDeclan Craggs, the mayor of Diss,
OL,12,FNorfolk, said Diss Town Council has
OL,13,Ftried using ultrasonic sound devices
OL,14,Fand employing a falconer's hawks to
OL,15,Fscare the pigeons away from Mere
OL,16,FStreet, but nothing has worked.
OL,18,FWhile many locals agree with the
OL,19,Fcouncil's actions, others feel the
OL,20,Fpigeons were being unfairly demonised.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
